{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37818","headline":"荆渚八月十五夜值雨寄同年李屿 · 郑谷","name":"荆渚八月十五夜值雨寄同年李屿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共待辉光夜，翻成黯澹秋。\n正宜清路望，潜起滴堦愁。\n棹倚袁宏渚，帘垂庾亮楼。\n桂无香实落，兰有露花休。\n玉漏添萧索，金尊阻献酬。\n明年佳景在，相约向神州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}